    "name": "Tennis Life",
    "steam_appid": 1879240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/afd30c325715243d82f5c84cca4ff34a.poster.avif?t=1741340372\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/afd30c325715243d82f5c84cca4ff34a.webm?t=1741340372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/afd30c325715243d82f5c84cca4ff34a.mp4?t=1741340372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game that allows you to simulate tennis gameplay in real-time online matches. It supports cross-platform play, even between desktop and mobile devices, with both singles and doubles modes available. Each character has a unique appearance. The game is already prepared for free-form building and dynamic lighting scenes. In the future, you will be able to manage a tennis club or play as an independent tennis player. The goal of this game is to simulate the entire tennis world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/afd30c325715243d82f5c84cca4ff34a.poster.avif?t=1741340372\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/afd30c325715243d82f5c84cca4ff34a.webm?t=1741340372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/afd30c325715243d82f5c84cca4ff34a.mp4?t=1741340372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game that allows you to simulate tennis gameplay in real-time online matches. It supports cross-platform play, even between desktop and mobile devices, with both singles and doubles modes available. Each character has a unique appearance. The game is already prepared for free-form building and dynamic lighting scenes. In the future, you will be able to manage a tennis club or play as an independent tennis player. The goal of this game is to simulate the entire tennis world.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a tennis-themed open-world game. From managing or joining a tennis club to every swing and movement on the court, you have full control.",
